      "q": "比较法布里-珀罗标准具和光栅的三个分光特性参数。",
      "a": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "v": "①自由光谱范围：<span class=\"m\">F</span> − <span class=\"m\">P</span> 标准具 (<span class=\"m\">Δλ</span>)<sub>f</sub> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"n\">λ</span><span class=\"d\"><span class=\"m\">m</span></span></span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"n\">λ<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"d\">2<span class=\"m\">nh</span></span></span>，光栅 <span class=\"m\">Δλ</span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"n\">λ</span><span class=\"d\"><span class=\"m\">m</span></span></span>"
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "v": "<span class=\"m\">F</span> − <span class=\"m\">P</span> 标准具干涉级次很高，而光栅使用的光谱级次 <span class=\"m\">m</span> 小，所以光栅的自由光谱范围要比 <span class=\"m\">F</span> − <span class=\"m\">P</span> 标准具的大得多。"
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "v": "②分辨本领：<span class=\"m\">F</span> − <span class=\"m\">P</span> 标准具 <span class=\"m\">A</span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"n\">λ</span><span class=\"d\">(<span class=\"m\">Δλ</span>)<sub>m</sub></span></span> = 0.97<span class=\"m\">mN</span>，光栅 <span class=\"m\">A</span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"n\">λ</span><span class=\"d\"><span class=\"m\">δλ</span></span></span> = <span class=\"m\">mN</span>"
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "v": "两者的分辨本领都很高，但光栅的高分辨来自于刻线数 <span class=\"m\">N</span> 很大，而 <span class=\"m\">F</span> − <span class=\"m\">P</span> 标准具来源于高干涉级次。"
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "v": "③色散：<span class=\"m\">F</span> − <span class=\"m\">P</span> 标准具 <span class=\"m\">D</span><sub>θ</sub> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"m\">dθ</span></span><span class=\"d\"><span class=\"m\">dλ</span></span></span> = |<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"m\">m</span></span><span class=\"d\">2<span class=\"m\">nh</span>sin<span class=\"m\">θ</span></span></span>|，光栅 <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"m\">dθ</span></span><span class=\"d\"><span class=\"m\">dλ</span></span></span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"m\">m</span></span><span class=\"d\"><span class=\"m\">d</span>cos<span class=\"m\">θ</span></span></span>"
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "v": "<span class=\"m\">F</span> − <span class=\"m\">P</span> 标准具中心处角色散最大，所以其中心处光谱最纯。光栅角色散与光栅常数 <span class=\"m\">d</span> 成反比，与级次 <span class=\"m\">m</span> 成正比，由于 <span class=\"m\">d</span> 通常很小，所以光栅具有很大的色散本领。"
        }
      ],
